        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-[#fcfaf6] mb-4 leading-tight">高雄臨時看護接住院檢查日：禁食、推床與家屬通知怎麼交班</h1>
        <p class="text-[#efe5d5] text-sm">2026-09-14 · 7 分鐘閱讀</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="bg-[#fcfaf6] py-12 lg:py-16">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
